# Weather — Settings › Weather (天气): the switch, the current report and the place search.
"%@, feels like %@, high %@, low %@" = "%1$@，体感 %2$@，最高 %3$@，最低 %4$@"
"Choose a place" = "选择地点"
"Choose a place in Settings › Weather." = "请在“设置 › 天气”中选择地点。"
"Couldn’t reach Open-Meteo. Rolltop will try again." = "无法连接 Open-Meteo。Rolltop 会再试一次。"
"Couldn’t search for places. Try again." = "无法搜索地点。请再试一次。"
"Loading…" = "正在载入…"
"Now" = "当前"
"Open-Meteo sent an incomplete answer. Rolltop will try again." = "Open-Meteo 返回的内容不完整。Rolltop 会再试一次。"
"Place" = "地点"
"Remove" = "移除"
"Search for a city" = "搜索城市"
"Show the weather" = "显示天气"
"Rolltop sends the approximate location of the place you choose to Open-Meteo (open-meteo.com), a free weather service, to get the forecast. Open-Meteo’s servers may log it with your IP address. Nothing is sent while this is off." = "Rolltop 会将你所选地点的大致位置发送给免费天气服务 Open-Meteo（open-meteo.com）以获取天气预报。Open-Meteo 的服务器可能会将其与你的 IP 地址一起记录。关闭时不会发送任何内容。"
"The chosen place is saved with your settings and included in backups." = "所选地点会随设置一起存储，并包含在备份中。"
"Weather" = "天气"
"What you type is sent to Open-Meteo to find matching places." = "你输入的内容会发送给 Open-Meteo 以查找匹配的地点。"
"weather, forecast, temperature, place, city, location, Open-Meteo" = "天气, 天气预报, 气温, 温度, 地点, 城市, 位置, Open-Meteo"
